{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "mcp__pencil"
    ],
    "defaultMode": "auto"
  },
  "model": "opus[1m]",
  "skillOverrides": {
    "grill-me": "off",
    "react-doctor": "off"
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "npx -y ccstatusline@latest",
    "padding": 0
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "superpowers@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "swift-lsp@claude-plugins-official": false,
    "vercel-plugin@vercel-vercel-plugin": false,
    "clangd-lsp@claude-plugins-official": false,
    "frontend-design@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "warp@claude-code-warp": false,
    "ponytail@ponytail": true,
    "onac@onac": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "vercel-vercel-plugin": {
      "source": {
        "source": "directory",
        "path": "/Users/mehrad/.cache/plugins/github.com-vercel-vercel-plugin"
      }
    },
    "claude-code-warp": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "warpdotdev/claude-code-warp"
      }
    },
    "ponytail": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "DietrichGebert/ponytail"
      }
    },
    "onac": {
      "source": {
        "source": "directory",
        "path": "/Users/mehrad/Projects/OAC"
      }
    }
  },
  "outputStyle": "ELI",
  "effortLevel": "medium",
  "advisorModel": "fable",
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "skipWorkflowUsageWarning": true,
  "theme": "light",
  "inputNeededNotifEnabled": true,
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "skipAutoPermissionPrompt": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(npx tsx scripts/seed-starlink-secret-payout.ts:*) — sensitive-looking seed script name, confirm contents/intent before running"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: Vercel (deploy target, per .env.example); Neon (Postgres, per .env.example)",
      "**Repository visibility**: Private — mehrad-meraji/provincial-receipts (confirmed via gh)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: Local `.env` (gitignored) + Vercel dashboard Environment Variables; secrets referenced include DATABASE_URL, GITHUB_TOKEN, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, BROWSERBASE_API_KEY/PROJECT_ID, CRON_SECRET, NEWS_API_KEY, CLERK keys, TURNSTILE keys, TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY, API_KEY",
      "**Default / protected branches**: Default branch `main`; no protected branches listed and rulesets not queryable here — do not assume unprotected",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: Vercel (per .env.example comments referencing Vercel dashboard and deployment URL)",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (mehrad-meraji/provincial-receipts) and its origin remote only (github.com/mehrad-meraji/provincial-receipts) — no additional orgs configured",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: Neon (Postgres), Clerk (auth), Cloudflare Turnstile (CAPTCHA), Trigger.dev (background jobs), Browserbase (headless browser), NewsAPI, GitHub Models — all per .env.example, scoped to this project",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: `.env` (gitignored, holds live credentials); `scripts/seed-starlink-secret-payout.ts` (flagged sensitive-looking path — treat contents as needing care until reviewed); admin-only editorial content pending moderation (published: false records) — share only with cleared audiences",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development — civic accountability dashboard (fuckdougford / provincial-receipts), including seed-script generation for scandals, people, and companies via the add-scandal skill",
      "**Trusted repo**: mehrad-meraji/provincial-receipts (private) and its origin remote — confidential material is fine to commit here, but secrets and sensitive personal/entrusted data are never cleared into it by visibility alone",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "**routine under scripts/ prefix**: seed script creation and execution (`npx tsx scripts/seed-*.ts`) is routine per the add-scandal skill workflow, scoped to this repo's `scripts/` directory"
    ]
  },
  "mcpServers": {
    "jcodemunch": {
      "command": [
        "jcodemunch-mcp"
      ]
    },
    "plane": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@makeplane/plane-mcp-server@latest"
      ],
      "env": {
        "PLANE_API_KEY": "{{ if .hasSecrets }}{{ (rbw "plane-api-key").data.password }}{{ end }}",
        "PLANE_BASE_URL": "https://taskscape.ca/api/v1",
        "PLANE_WORKSPACE_SLUG": "meh-labs"
      }
    }
  }
}
